Improved: Several ReferenceCell member functions
(ReferenceCell::face_to_cell_vertices(),
ReferenceCell::standard_to_real_face_vertex(),
ReferenceCell::face_to_cell_line_orientation(), and
ReferenceCell::standard_to_real_face_line()) were optimized and can, with a
`constexpr ReferenceCell`, now be inlined. These optimizations make uniform
refinement of a tetrahedral Triangulation about 16\% less expensive (as measured
by callgrind).
<br>
(David Wells, 2026/08/01)
